    "summary": "Native22 remains a terminal comparator and the exact signed-pair three-bank branch is experimentally falsified by review ad3c619c. Runtime V1R5 manifest b3e45487 and GO 0fd62b52, plus deployment inference V1R6 tuple aaddc2c4/b5ca50c1/6e9ff901/2535b720/8bd46e45 and GO bb092a3d, are solved static-only. All live gates remain closed. The science frontier is exactly support>=3 K6 and J-by-pair; exact-min-H and pair-on/zero gating remain visible only as closed diagnostics, never as a retry of V4R2. The support>=3 lane now records controller V1R3 final GO and consumed one-shot result, the exact unsealed scope metadata, static-only sealer V1R1, and the interrupted null-root V1R2 WIP as a nonauthoritative handoff. Gate-1 screen falsification closes support>=3 K6 source viability (0/315); the science frontier reduces to enriched-J by pair, which now lacks any named viable source class. With G18E reduced to the Gate-0 external constraint, every leaf of the signed-pair/late-q program is terminal: falsified, measured, closed in form, or blocked on a named external object.",
    "terminal_criterion": "Resolve the two open independently preregistered science leaves with fresh authority and leakage-safe held-out or nested evaluation. Preserve the two closed diagnostic leaves without spending the one-shot. Never reopen the consumed V4R2 transaction or treat static Runtime/inference GO as live authority.",
